Description: Advanced Web Application Security Scanner with AI-powered vulnerability analysis
 Waymap is a fast, practical web vulnerability scanner for authorized security testing.
 It automates SQLi, XSS, command injection, SSTI, LFI, CORS, CRLF, open redirect, API,
 recon, misconfiguration, and WordPress checks - with session-based results, multi-threading,
 crawling, authentication, reporting, Google dork discovery, and AI-powered vulnerability analysis.
 .
 Features:
  - SQL Injection (boolean, error, time-based, union, stacked, inline)
  - Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) with context-aware detection
  - Command Injection (CMDi) with multiple techniques
  - Server-Side Template Injection (SSTI)
  - Local File Inclusion (LFI)
  - CRLF and Header Injection
  - CORS Misconfiguration
  - Open Redirect
  - API Security Testing (REST and GraphQL)
  - WordPress Security Scanning
  - Google Dork Discovery via SerpApi
  - AI-powered vulnerability analysis with multiple LLM providers
  - Multi-threaded scanning with configurable workers
  - Intelligent crawling and attack surface discovery
  - Comprehensive reporting (HTML, CSV, Markdown, PDF)
 .
 This tool is intended for authorized security testing and educational use only.
